<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" version="1.1" creator="RydAR">
  <metadata>
    <name>Haden Rd, Benton County / simulator showcase</name>
    <desc>Follows the Arkansas GIS Office centerline of Haden Rd (unpaved), south to north, 2150 m, through all four bundled curves on the road (007-517-1496, 1495, 1492, 1491). Those curves lie within 1 m of this line. Replay never uploads.</desc>
